cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SHIFTGUARD, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "SHIFTGUARD: calibration under input-field outages"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible workbench that rehearses input-field outages on a tabular model
  (random cell loss, structured history-block loss and rate-matched loss) and measures
  calibration, decision loss and the label budget needed to recalibrate, on the UCI Bank
  Marketing data. Results in this release are single-seed development evidence.
authors:
  - given-names: Abhinav
    family-names: Anand
repository-code: "https://github.com/The-Abhinav-Anand/shiftguard"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-30
keywords:
  - calibration
  - distribution shift
  - missing data
  - tabular machine learning
  - recalibration
  - benchmark
